Subject: [PATCH 59/63] add framework hypervisor to Android.bp targets

Summary:
# Motivation:
D102697364 needs to link with this dylib
# Overview:
- add framework Hypervisor

Test Plan:
```
 . build/envsetup.sh && lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug && m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
```

